{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iSmoke 是一款按個人方式戒煙的輔助工具，適合希望循序減少、自訂日期直接戒斷或維持每日吸煙上限的人。App 原價 US $9.99，目前限時免費，讓你以自己的節奏掌握戒煙進度。</p>\n\n<h2>個人化戒煙計劃</h2>\n<p>iSmoke 提供 Taper、Cold turkey 與 Maintain 三種戒煙路線，並按實際記錄重新計算計劃。一鍵記錄香煙後，連續日數、累積節省金錢與健康恢復時間表會自動更新，同時顯示距離下次預計吸煙時段的倒數。App 內有 AI 教練、4-7-8 呼吸練習、三分鐘倒數及記憶遊戲等替代活動；即使偶爾失手，累計無煙日數與已節省金錢也不會被抹去。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-270-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-271-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-272-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-273-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-274-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-275-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iSmoke – Quit Smoking</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T02:21:05.356190+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}